WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.771
Choosing a health plan can feel like a guess.

2
00:00:04.191 --> 00:00:08.941
HerePup helps you decide with something you already have: your own claims history.

3
00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:12.242
Let's walk through it together, one step at a time.

4
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.841
You can use HerePup any time your coverage choice matters.

5
00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:25.413
At open enrollment, when you start a new job, after a life event like marriage or a new baby, or just to plan the year ahead.

6
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:29.479
It runs right in your web browser, so there's nothing to install.

7
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.085
First, tell HerePup who's on your coverage.

8
00:00:33.505 --> 00:00:35.350
First names are perfectly fine.

9
00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.837
Just mark each person as an adult, or a child.

10
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.695
Next, drag in each employer's benefit guide. Even a scanned one works.

11
00:00:45.115 --> 00:00:53.838
HerePup reads every plan option for you: the deductibles, the out-of-pocket limits, the copays, and what each one costs per paycheck.

12
00:00:54.258 --> 00:00:56.699
You can check, and change, every number.

13
00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:06.016
Before your answer, HerePup checks one thing for every plan: does it come with a health savings account, and how much does your employer put in?

14
00:01:06.436 --> 00:01:11.962
Guides often leave it out, and it can change the answer, so HerePup won't let it slip by.

15
00:01:12.382 --> 00:01:17.160
And if you need a certain kind of plan, you can tell HerePup to consider only those.

16
00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.332
Then, bring in your claims history.

17
00:01:20.752 --> 00:01:27.773
Download the statements or claims file from your insurer's website, and drag them in. The last twelve months works best.

18
00:01:28.193 --> 00:01:33.791
Direct connections to insurers are on the way, and you can request yours with a single click.

19
00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:42.636
HerePup works out what kind of care each claim was, like a specialist visit, a trip to urgent care, or a prescription.

20
00:01:43.056 --> 00:01:46.749
Then it models how that care would be covered under every plan.

21
00:01:47.169 --> 00:01:50.829
A small copay on one, and the full deductible on another.

22
00:01:52.030 --> 00:02:00.511
And here's your answer: the plan most likely to cost your household the least, with premiums, care, and employer savings all counted in.

23
00:02:00.931 --> 00:02:05.275
HerePup even tests splitting your family across two employers' plans.

24
00:02:05.695 --> 00:02:12.637
Expecting a busier year, or a lighter one? Slide to adjust, and HerePup shows you if the best choice would change.

25
00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.622
Next, see it month by month.

26
00:02:16.042 --> 00:02:26.193
A low-deductible plan spreads its cost evenly through premiums. A high-deductible plan costs less up front, but can bring big bills in the months you need care.

27
00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:31.459
HerePup shows when the costs are likely to land, and how much to set aside for them.

28
00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:37.015
HerePup also shows where your money went, and where the same care costs less.

29
00:02:37.435 --> 00:02:42.160
One urgent care against another, or the same scan at two imaging centers.

30
00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.479
So next time, you can choose the lower-cost one.

31
00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:51.511
Through all of this, your documents are read right in your browser, on your own device.

32
00:02:51.931 --> 00:02:57.814
They're never uploaded, sold, or shared, and you can delete everything, any time, with a single click.

33
00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:03.145
No guesswork. Just your own story, and the year ahead, made clear.

34
00:03:03.565 --> 00:03:06.734
Try it at HerePup dot health, and tell us how it went.

35
00:03:07.154 --> 00:03:10.049
HerePup. Pick your plan, with confidence.

